582 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 192 0 R
/E (On the in-distribution validation set the two are within 0.001 F1 of each other \(0.586 vs. 0.585\), and v4_full's 1.5% empty-frame FPR beats v4_aug's 4.1%. The augmented model was chosen for deployment because the temperature-shift and noise augmentations directly model the domain gap between the collection sensor and the Jetson sensor - a gap the validation set cannot see. That is a judgement call, and it is the one claim in this report that is not yet backed by a measurement.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [25]
>>
endobj
